Title:          GCDROM
Description:    SATA native IDE CD/DVD-ROM driver
Keywords:       CD-ROM driver, SATA, driver
Summary:        SATA native IDE CD/DVD-ROM driver that supports all SATA Native IDE controllers, such as Intel ICH6/ICH7/ICH8, Jmicron 363/368, Nvidia CK804 MCP55/MCP51 etc.
